{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">FRAME-FILE function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309526","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/FRAME-FILE-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/FRAME-FILE-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"FRAME-FILE-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">FRAME-FILE function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"FRAME-FILE-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the name of the database table that\ncontains the field the cursor is in. The FRAME-FILE function is\nuseful if you want to provide users with context-sensitive help.</p>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\" id=\"FRAME-FILE-function__note_N1002E_N10024_N10021_N10001\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> Does not apply to SpeedScript programming.</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"FRAME-FILE-function__syntax_GC17MI2692860\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d125400e99\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"FRAME-FILE-function__idGDL2G72670753\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>FRAME-FILE</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"FRAME-FILE-function__example_GC17MJ2692864\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d125400e125\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure updates fields from the Order table and the Customer table. It\nuses the FRAME-FILE function to tell you which table contains the\nfield being updated.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-frfile.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"FRAME-FILE-function__idGDL2G82670757\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>FOR EACH Customer, EACH Order OF Customer:\n  DISPLAY Order.OrderNum WITH CENTERED ROW 2 FRAME onum.\n  UPDATE\n    Customer.CustNnum AT 5 Order.CustNum AT 30 SKIP\n    Customer.Name AT 5\n    Customer.City AT 5\n    Customer.State AT 5\n    Customer.PostalCode AT 5\n    WITH ROW 8 CENTERED 1 DOWN NO-LABELS EDITING:\n    MESSAGE &quot;The field&quot; FRAME-FIELD &quot;is from the&quot; <strong class=\"ph b\">FRAME-FILE </strong>&quot;file&quot;.\n    READKEY.\n    APPLY LASTKEY.\n  END. /* EDITING */\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"FRAME-FILE-function__notes_GC17MK2692870\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d125400e163\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">FRAME-FILE\nreturns a null string if the frame field being entered is not associated\nwith a database field.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">If the cursor is not in an enabled input field when the last\ninput statement ends, FRAME-FILE returns a null string.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">The FRAME-FILE value is set to blanks at the next PAUSE statement, at\nthe next READKEY statement, or when the AVM pauses automatically.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"FRAME-FILE-function__see-also_GC17MM2692874\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d125400e181\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"FRAME-FIELD-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-FIELD-function.html\">FRAME-FIELD function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"FRAME-VALUE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-VALUE-function.html\">FRAME-VALUE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PROGRAM-NAME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PROGRAM-NAME-function.html\">PROGRAM-NAME function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"FRAME-FIELD-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-FIELD-function.html\">FRAME-FIELD function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"FRAME-INDEX-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-INDEX-function.html\">FRAME-INDEX function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309526","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"FRAME-FILE function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-FILE-function.html","type":"Manual"}